The `UploadDataToCloudStorageAsync` method is not implemented here, as it depends on your specific cloud storage service. However, you can use this method to upload the data to a cloud storage service of your choice.

This code also uses the `ILogger` interface to log any errors that may occur during processing. The `ConfigureAwait(false)` method is used to ensure that the asynchronous methods are executed in parallel, which can improve performance.']

