3. Performance considerations include minimizing memory allocation frequency and optimizing cache usage.
4. Integration with a logging framework to record session creation and expiration events.
5. Robustness under stress conditions, including edge cases where the session list overflows or underflows.
6. Graceful degradation when resources are exhausted, allowing the application to continue operation with reduced functionality rather than crashing entirely.']

