The class also includes nested configurations for hierarchical random value generation, allowing users to create custom generators with specific ranges for each field. The class supports multi-threaded operations and ensures thread-safe access to shared resources, avoiding race conditions during concurrent updates. Additionally, the class implements a mechanism to limit the maximum number of instances of `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T` that can be generated per second, preventing excessive memory consumption and processing load.

