This code implements a modular C function suite named `NetworkStats` that provides real-time network monitoring capabilities for distributed systems managing large-scale IoT device communications. The function suite uses a high-resolution timer to measure packet processing latency and network throughput, supports multi-threaded environments for concurrent data collection, and efficiently gathers and processes network metrics such as byte count, packet count, and error rates.

